title: "Swarm Seek: A literature-validated Artificial Bee Colony library for Python"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python package implementing Artificial Bee Colony (ABC)
  optimization and principal peer-reviewed continuous variants, with a NumPy
  core, ask/tell API, and automated regression tests against published
  benchmark figures.
